OL,3,GNEWSATeen advised not to fell tree that
OL,4,Akilled him, inquest told
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn apprentice tree surgeon had been
OL,7,Fadvised not to fell the tree that
OL,8,Fkilled him, an inquest has been told.
OL,10,FJonty Parkinson was working in woodland
OL,11,Fon a National Trust site near
OL,12,FFaringdon, in Oxfordshire on 6
OL,13,FSeptember 2024 when he was crushed by a
OL,14,Ftree that did not fall in the intended
OL,15,Fway.
OL,17,FPaying tribute to the 18-year-old at an
OL,18,Finquest in Oxford on Tuesday, his
OL,19,Fmother Ali Cockayne said her son had a
OL,20,F"real zest for life".
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
