OL,3,GNEWSATeen advised not to fell tree that
OL,4,Akilled him, inquest told
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis manager George Green said he had
OL,7,Finstructed Parkinson and his colleague
OL,8,FJoe Bristow to dismantle the 12m (39ft)
OL,9,Ftall tree in sections.
